      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Blue Sky Property is delighted to present No. 18 Hyde Park, a beautifully presented four-bedroom townhouse that has been completely transformed by a large, high-quality ground floor extension to the rear. \r\n\r\nThis is not your typical Hyde Park townhouse. Extending to over 125 sqm across two levels, it feels far more spacious than it looks from the street, with style and natural light throughout. The extension has created a superb open-plan kitchen, living and dining space, the kind of room most buyers hope for and rarely find in a town-centre home. \r\n\r\nThe property benefits from oil-fired central heating, along with an open fire with back boiler, providing an additional source of warmth and comfort.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there’s a master bedroom with en-suite bathroom, two further bedrooms and a family bathroom. \r\n\r\nOutside, the rear garden is a real showpiece, good enough to win a medal in any garden design competition. It has given the current owners years of pleasure and will do the same for its next owner.\r\n\r\nTurnkey and finished to a top standard, No. 18 offers the space of a suburban home with the convenience of town-centre living. Viewing comes highly recommended.\r\n\r\nTo arrange a viewing, contact Blue Sky Property on 042 9329333. Guide Price €285,000. \r\n\r\nLocation: No. 18 sits in a prime, central position on Hyde Park, one of Dundalk's most long established and sought-after town-centre streets, just off Quay Street and Barrack Street. \r\n\r\nThis is true town-centre living, where you can genuinely leave the car at home. Hyde Park is known for its convenience and strong sense of community. Shops, restaurants, cafés, bars, local gaa, navy bank walk and every possible amenity and service on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nClarke Station is a 15 minute walk away, with direct services to Dublin Connolly and Belfast on the Enterprise. Buses run north and south from Quay Street, and the M1 Dublin–Belfast motorway is just 1km away.\r\n\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
